@startuml
title UML — Timing Diagram

robust  "User"   as U
concise "Web UI" as W
concise "Server" as S

@0
U is Idle
W is Idle
S is Idle

@100
U is Active
W is Loading

@250
W is Idle  : page rendered

@300
U is Active
S is Working

@500
S is Idle  : response sent

@600
U is Idle

highlight 100 to 250 #LightBlue : page load
highlight 300 to 500 #LightYellow : API call
@enduml
